  "title": "Nvidia CEO Jensen Huang's Leadership Transition and Alleged Chinese Spy Issues",
  "summary": "Nvidia faces a potential leadership vacuum as its CEO, Jensen Huang, resigns after an alleged extramarital affair with a Singapore-based executive, while also facing allegations of a relationship with an alleged Chinese spy. The company is exploring whether such an affair could influence its dealings with AI technology and global supply chains.",
  "facts": [
