    {
      "statement": "Nvidia’s board is considering reinstating him but faces challenges related to his alleged extramarital affair and potential national security concerns",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Nvidia’s stock price fell by 8% after the resignation, and the company is exploring whether such an affair could influence its dealings with AI technology",
      "confidence": 0.95
